data: {"id": "6a6a03680b804d45-thinking-parallel_evidence-698", "run_id": "6a6a03680b804d45", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我有了完整的证据链。让我总结一下：\n\n## 证据结论\n\n**实体**: `aiops-case-v02/workload`  \n**Pod UID**: `49f4b3a0-c450-44f9-8baf-ce88e4ed74c4`\n\n### 已确认事实\n\n1. **Pod 状态确认**\n   - `kubectl describe` 显示 Pod 状态为 `Pending`，`node: <none>`\n   - Prometheus metrics 确认 `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}=1`，其他 phase=0\n   - 容器名 `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n\n2. **调度失败原因**\n   - 调度器事件：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789113592947, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

